{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Cleaning is a cozy, family-friendly game where you tidy up a baby\u2019s messes in a playful environment. Use various cleaning utensils to clean rooms, and enjoy the satisfaction of a sparkling home!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351020/extras/9c7eaccfa41c3097c13017e52b12308e.webp?t=1772361410\" width=584 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351020/extras/908bd38951c2f02cf82b748e48f2b96b.poster.avif?t=1772361410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351020/extras/908bd38951c2f02cf82b748e48f2b96b.webm?t=1772361410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351020/extras/908bd38951c2f02cf82b748e48f2b96b.mp4?t=1772361410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351020/extras/9c7eaccfa41c3097c13017e52b12308e.webp?t=1772361410\" width=584 height=41 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Home Cleaning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home Cleaning is a wholesome, family-friendly game where players tidy up a baby\u2019s messes around the house. With fun, interactive point-and-click gameplay, each level invites players to bring order to a cozy, lively home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351020/extras/9c7eaccfa41c3097c13017e52b12308e.webp?t=1772361410\